### WeatherAI - Test Scenarios
### REST Client (VS Code extension: humao.rest-client)
### Run each scenario with Ctrl+Alt+R (or click "Send Request" above each ###)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Scenario 1 - Perfect sunny day
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### Scenario 1: Perfect sunny day
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/weather
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": -20.2,
  "longitude": 57.5,
  "temp": 28,
  "humidity": 40,
  "probabilityOfRain": 5
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Scenario 2 - Heavy rain incoming
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### Scenario 2: Heavy rain incoming
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/weather
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": -20.2,
  "longitude": 57.5,
  "temp": 22,
  "humidity": 95,
  "probabilityOfRain": 90
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Scenario 3 - Hot and humid
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### Scenario 3: Hot and humid
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/weather
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": -20.2,
  "longitude": 57.5,
  "temp": 38,
  "humidity": 85,
  "probabilityOfRain": 20
}

